// Format: rst_sel[1:0]_in1[2:0]_in2[2:0]_out_expected[0:6]
// Total: 16 bits per line

// 0. Initial Reset
1_00_000_000_0000000

// 1. sel=0 (Pass in2): in2=5(101). Expected: 5 (0000101)
0_00_010_101_0000101

// 2. sel=1 (ADD) Normal: 7+2=9. Expected: 9 (0001001)
0_01_111_010_0001001

// 3. sel=2 (Pass in1): in1=4(100). Expected: 4 (0000100)
0_10_100_001_0000100

// 4. MAXIMUM ADD: in1=7(111), in2=7(111). Expected: 14 (0001110)
0_01_111_111_0001110

// 5. ZERO ADD: in1=0(000), in2=0(000). Expected: 0 (0000000)
0_01_000_000_0000000

// 6. Mid-Flight Reset: rst=1 while trying to ADD. Expected: 0
1_01_011_011_0000000

// 7. sel=3 (Default/Invalid state) -> 'a' gets xxxx. 
// 'b' adds three 0s, resulting in 000xxxx.
0_11_000_000_000xxxx